From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bsp2020 <bsp2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 16:52:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 33/48] moe cache: the persisted-heat seed of a sparse (mmap)
 table fills through the tier code

apply_heat_seed_locked was the one seed site still calling fill_slot_from_host for a host_sparse table (the
prefill and sizing seeds already use seed_fill_slot_locked).  It was unreachable in mmap mode until the heat
map was opened there; with a loaded map, warm starts stalled for more than 15 minutes in the pageable copies.

(cherry picked from commit eacd9ddf995fa6852b5746eb5b7b67e223749f4f)
(cherry picked from commit b4feaf01c4de9d958ee7aad93e3bbf8edfad82f7)
(cherry picked from commit ac8ec254629c63c20438c989c65bd28473993819)
---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/moe-expert-cache.cu | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/moe-expert-cache.cu b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/moe-expert-cache.cu
index a513b31318..75416e74fb 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/moe-expert-cache.cu
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/moe-expert-cache.cu
@@ -5579,8 +5579,10 @@ void apply_heat_seed_locked(table_t & t) {
                 break;
             }
         } else {
-            // wip/host-expert-master-drop (TODO #55): the same geometry-aware source the eager fill uses.
-            const cudaError_t err = fill_slot_from_host(t, dst, (size_t) e, (cudaStream_t) 0);
+            // wip/host-expert-master-drop (TODO #55): the same geometry-aware source the eager fill uses.  A sparse
+            // (mmap) table seeds through the tier code, as the prefill and sizing seeds do (a pageable copy from the
+            // mapping stalled warm starts for > 15 min).
+            const cudaError_t err = t.host_sparse ? seed_fill_slot_locked(t, dst, e) : fill_slot_from_host(t, dst, (size_t) e, (cudaStream_t) 0);
             if (err != cudaSuccess) {
                 (void) cudaGetLastError();
                 ok = false;
-- 
